tras/84d0409e249919f531c16c9a3bda4520.webm?t=1770107193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530170/extras/84d0409e249919f531c16c9a3bda4520.mp4?t=1770107193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔹Knight, Mage, Archer</strong> and many more classic fantasy unit types, each with its own set of abilities helping you out in your journey!</p>",
